                    {
                        "sense_id": "52902d9b-471c-3842-b048-6fdfdd504d4d",
                        "entry_id": "3aea844d-410b-3de9-8710-8e0890c0e859",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To coat with cosmoline."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a91caf1-0c3e-4f5c-9c60-6f3c67e53e0b",
                                "sense_id": "52902d9b-471c-3842-b048-6fdfdd504d4d",
                                "text": "With the Model 1917 tripod, the pintle should be removed from the socket from time to time, wiped clean and lightly oiled or cosmolined where there is friction between it and the socket."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "008b4096-20f7-4bf8-84b4-7185cbd311cc",
                                "sense_id": "52902d9b-471c-3842-b048-6fdfdd504d4d",
                                "text": "Now, as I understand it you testified that that would lead to the inference that they did not fear an attack and you said that they had the guns themselves there on the ships but they were cosmolined and could not fire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a64e2a2e-d744-4b80-8267-ac93e330766d",
                                "sense_id": "52902d9b-471c-3842-b048-6fdfdd504d4d",
                                "text": "Its howitzers were turned in to \"ordnance and to cosmoline\" on the next day, for the war in Europe was ending."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40f6b736-a46d-4b71-a4c7-2f2f4c5087a2",
                                "sense_id": "52902d9b-471c-3842-b048-6fdfdd504d4d",
                                "text": "It told in English and German, how an American Ordinance worked, such as receiving the items, giving them numbers, assigning the storage locations, cleaning and cosmolining or applying grease to them."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
